--- a/src/php_spx.c	2026-06-30 20:00:21.468275241 +0000
+++ b/src/php_spx.c	2026-06-30 20:07:48.418012288 +0000
@@ -15,6 +15,12 @@
  * along with this program.  If not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
